    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Stack</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Expression parsing</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/basic-calculator-ii/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 227</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Basic Calculator II</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">An expression without brackets is a sum of signed terms, and only the term you are reading can still change. Keep a settled total plus the last term: '+' and '-' close the term, '*' and '/' change it in place. One pass, O(n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
